Lunacy's artwork.

LunacyRobot.png (the Android robot with a door open on the night sky and the moon) is Lunacy's
icon; LunaOnly.png, LunaRound.png and LunaSquare.png are the moon on its own, kept in reserve as
an alternative icon. codepoet had them made with ChatGPT for Lunacy, 2026-11-07.
AndroidLuna/tools/make-icons.py makes the launcher icon, the splash logo and the notification
icon from them.

